n10le09ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le09ob10re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le09ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Come on in Adam, and have a seat. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Thanks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: How has your week gone? Mr. Brody called me to check if you were settling in.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Okay, I think. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: I infer from that response that it could have been better. We need to talk about your performance this week. According to some of the other copy editors, you have not really been pulling your weight. The team says that you haven't pitched in as much as you could have.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: What do you mean? I've done everything that I've been asked to do. I did the filing and the photocopying that Mr. Brody asked me to do. He claimed that I had done a good job.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Okay, but that was just the first day. What about the paper?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: I put in a paper order over the phone.<br><span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: Okay. You ordered the wrong type of paper. That paper can't be returned and is hugely expensive. We can't use it so we will have to see if we can sell it to another printer. Mr. Brody asked me how this mistake could have been made.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Your comments imply that I made a mistake, but I ordered what you told me to order.", "time": "36500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le09ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Brown</span>: I called the supplier and spoke to the sales rep. She reported that you were very unclear on the phone, and she had a hard time understanding you. In the words of the rep, you really \u201cmuddled it up.\u201d She suggested that you get the order straight before you make the call. Adam, if you are unclear about any part of this job, you need to ask questions and make sure you know what you are doing. Mistakes in this business are hard to fix and can be very costly.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Okay. I'm sorry. I'll do it better next week.", "time": "63500", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}], "type": "sena"}